cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Smart2Raw: auto-adaptive integer numeric storage (header-only, C)"
abstract: >-
  A header-only C library that stores integer arrays in the smallest native
  class that fits the real range (±8/16/32/64 bits) and operates directly on
  the compact format: SIMD-dispatched aggregations and predicates with runtime
  dispatch, block-wise width (PFOR) with frame of reference and zone
  statistics, zero-copy mmap, portable I/O with CRC32 and analytics on the
  compact data.
